{"id":"wb-8-309","name":"姥山塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"姥山塔","text":"姥（mǔ）山塔，又称文峰塔、望湖塔，位于安徽省巢湖中央的姥山岛之上，塔高7层51米，塔内藏有25幅匾额和802尊砖雕佛像。1998年5月成为第四批安徽省文物保护单位，2019年10月成为第八批全国文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A7%A5%E5%B1%B1%E5%A1%94","revisionId":88797761,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88797761","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2d003295f00a5d54a227bc3c.jpg","title":"姥山岛.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A7%A5%E5%B1%B1%E5%B2%9B.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d5/%E5%A7%A5%E5%B1%B1%E5%B2%9B.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"钉钉","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​安徽巢湖姥山岛","width":320,"height":180}}